</span></span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Palatino Linotype";
color:black'>Gang Wu (now at Microsoft)</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.25in;text-indent:-.25in'><span
style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Wingdings;color:black'><img width=4
height=11 src="Edward_Y_Chang_files/image001.gif" alt="*"><span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Palatino Linotype";
color:black'>Yi Wu (now at Intel Research)</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.25in;text-indent:-.25in'><span
style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Wingdings;color:black'><img width=4
height=11 src="Edward_Y_Chang_files/image001.gif" alt="*"><span
style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Palatino Linotype";
color:black'>Zhihua Zhang (now at UC Berkeley)</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Palatino Linotype";
color:blue'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Palatino Linotype";
color:blue'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.5in'><span
style='font-family:"Palatino Linotype";color:blue'>III.<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span><span style='font-family:"Palatino Linotype";color:blue'>Key
Results</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-family:"Palatino Linotype";color:blue'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Palatino Linotype";
color:black'>Results of 1<sup>st</sup> year (Sept 2006 - Aug 2007):</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Palatino Linotype";
color:black'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Palatino Linotype";
color:black'>We have made two contributions, though this project is only at its
early stage.&nbsp; </span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Palatino Linotype";
color:black'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Palatino Linotype";
color:black'>First, we demonstrated that matrix inversion can be parallelized
on distributed computers.&nbsp; This parallelization is achieved through
approximate matrix factorization and intelligently reordering computation
steps.&nbsp; This method has been applied to parallelizing SVMs, and we are
exploring to use it to parallelize other mission-critical algorithms including
SVD and EM.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Palatino Linotype";
color:black'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Palatino Linotype";
color:black'>Second, we showed that in even an infinite dimensional space,
indexing can be done effectively.&nbsp; This is accomplished by projecting data
to the surface of a hypersphere, and then dividing the surface into concentric
regions for indexing.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Palatino Linotype";
color:black'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Palatino Linotype";
color:black'>The PI expects the benefits of these two contributions to be
further developed and explored in the 2nd year of the project.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-family:"Palatino Linotype";color:blue'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-family:"Palatino Linotype";color:blue'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.5in'><span
style='font-family:"Palatino Linotype";color:blue'>IV.<span style='font:7.0pt "Times New Roman"'>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
</span></span><span style='font-family:"Palatino Linotype";color:blue'>Publications</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-family:"Palatino Linotype";color:blue'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Palatino Linotype";
color:black'>Publications are listed by the three thrusts of this research
project.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Palatino Linotype";
color:black'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-left:.25in;text-indent:-.25in'><span
